## 2. Architecture Overview

The LangGraph pipeline currently runs as a Python script. To make it usable by Kuber's existing services (Java Spring Boot Loan Service), the Streamlit UI (Day 5), and external consumers, a REST API layer is needed.

Deployment model: single ECS Fargate service running FastAPI + LangGraph. Not Lambda-per-agent (cold starts, 15-min timeout). Not EKS (overkill). Fargate provides persistent containers, predictable latency, simple scaling, and Redis connectivity for checkpointing.

