## 5. Spring Boot ↔ FastAPI Mapping

| Spring Boot | FastAPI |
|-------------|---------|
| `@SpringBootApplication` | `FastAPI()` |
| `@PostMapping("/evaluate")` | `@app.post("/evaluate")` |
| `@GetMapping("/{id}/status")` | `@app.get("/{id}/status")` |
| Java Record / DTO | Pydantic BaseModel |
| `@Valid` + Bean Validation | Automatic (Pydantic validates) |
| `@Autowired` / Constructor Injection | `Depends()` |
| `ResponseStatusException` | `HTTPException` |
| `@Async` + `CompletableFuture` | `BackgroundTasks` |
| `@PostConstruct` / `@PreDestroy` | `lifespan` context manager |
| `@PreAuthorize` / `SecurityFilterChain` | `Depends(verify_token)` |
| `/actuator/health` | `@app.get("/health")` |
| Embedded Tomcat | Gunicorn + Uvicorn workers |
| SpringDoc / Swagger | Auto at `/docs` (built-in) |

