## 7. ECS Fargate Deployment Architecture

```
ALB → ECS Fargate Service (2–8 tasks, auto-scaling on CPU)
                ↓
    ┌───────────┼───────────┐
    ↓           ↓           ↓
  Redis      Bedrock    OpenSearch
  (ckpt)     (LLMs)     (RAG)
```

- **Auto-scaling:** Scale up above 60% CPU, down below 30%. Min 2, max 8 tasks.
- **Capacity:** 2 tasks × 4 workers = 8 concurrent requests minimum.
- **Health check:** ALB pings `/health` every 30 seconds. Non-200 → container replaced.

